<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Santam lifts first half EPS.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Santam lifts first half EPS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)		 139	   vs    105</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   38	   vs     32</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    101	   vs     76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    132	   vs     97</p>
<p>    Tax			   31	   vs     21</p>
<p>    Interest received	 55	   vs     39</p>
<p>    Gross premium income 1,176	   vs    999</p>
<p>Div payable July 25, 1997</p>
<p>on register June 27, 1997</p>
<p>Full name: Santam Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Santam said competition in short-term market was exerting increased pressure on premium rates but government and business sector efforts were seen reducing the level of crime-related claims.</p>
<p>Santam expected to achieve good underwriting results during the next six months and dividends for the year to increase by at least 15 percent.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
